window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The highly anticipated conclusion to Volume I.</b></p> <p>Parker Stevens is not who he thought he was. He's Cassien Alaris, Prince of the Dark Court. He's stronger, faster...darker. And he embraces it. Even if accepting who he is means losing the one he loves. The Darkness is more tempting.</p> <p>Luna Ainsworth has a responsibility to save her people. Her life was never her own. She knows who she is and what she must do. Her role comes with certain sacrifices. As Queen of the Elite Light Tylwyth Teg, she must defeat Darkness, even if it means losing a part of her.</p> <p>In a realm of magic, prophecies, and generations of bad blood, maybe love is the only way to end the battle between Dark and Light. Or is love just in the way?</p>"; 
